---
import DetailLayout from "../layouts/DetailLayout.astro";
import PackingList from "../components/tools/PackingList";
---

<DetailLayout
  title="China Packing List Generator"
  subtitle="Select your season and activities to get a customized packing checklist."
  description="Free China packing list generator. Choose your season and planned activities to get a personalized, printable packing checklist for your trip."
>
  <p class="mb-8 text-stone-600">Tell us when you're coming and what you plan to do — we'll generate a packing checklist with all the essentials plus activity-specific items. Check items off as you pack.</p>
  <PackingList client:idle />

  <h2>How the Generator Works</h2>
  <h3>Your Season Decides the Layers</h3>
  <p>Guilin weather swings from 40°C humid summers to cold, damp winters. The list adapts: rain shell and dry bags in spring, sun protection in summer, layers for December.</p>
  <h3>Activity Modules</h3>
  <p>Pick what you'll actually do — cycling, climbing, rafting, photography — and the list adds the specific gear. Each item can be checked off as it goes in the bag.</p>

  <h2>Two Things People Always Forget</h2>
  <p>Toilet paper and a power bank. Rural public toilets rarely provide the first, and a dead phone in a village with no English signage is the second's specialty. Everything else is covered below.</p>

  <div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50 p-6">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400">Continue Reading</p>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
      <li><a href="/best-time-to-visit-guilin/" class="text-accent hover:underline">Best Time to Visit</a></li>
      <li><a href="/guilin-food/" class="text-accent hover:underline">Guilin Food Guide</a></li>
      <li><a href="/yangshuo-cycling-routes/" class="text-accent hover:underline">Yangshuo Cycling Routes</a></li>
      <li><a href="/survival-chinese-phrases/" class="text-accent hover:underline">Survival Chinese Phrases</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

</DetailLayout>
